[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13802.07, "timestamp": "03:50:02", "text": "狗？不，呃，日本人不说话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13804.71, "timestamp": "03:50:04", "text": "显然太多了，是的，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13807.03, "timestamp": "03:50:07", "text": "除非你知道他们有自己的……，否则不要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13809.83, "timestamp": "03:50:09", "text": "朋友之间的界限等等，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13812.95, "timestamp": "03:50:12", "text": "严格的界限之类的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13820.07, "timestamp": "03:50:20", "text": "所以它非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13822.309, "timestamp": "03:50:22", "text": "是的。你必须喜欢，因为你就是。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13825.349, "timestamp": "03:50:25", "text": "就像进入一个完全不同的世界"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13829.11, "timestamp": "03:50:29", "text": "文化环境。嗯。不不，没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13831.99, "timestamp": "03:50:31", "text": "这已经是一个国家问题了。没有已经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13834.71, "timestamp": "03:50:34", "text": "异国他乡，但文化压力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13837.03, "timestamp": "03:50:37", "text": "在这样的地方，那就太过分了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13839.11, "timestamp": "03:50:39", "text": "他们不接受任何其他东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13842.15, "timestamp": "03:50:42", "text": "你所了解的文化。是的，他们就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13845.03, "timestamp": "03:50:45", "text": "严格来说，那样做是件好事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13847.429, "timestamp": "03:50:47", "text": "他们就像他们完全专注于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13850.63, "timestamp": "03:50:50", "text": "他们的文化，但是，呃，这真的很不好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13859.11, "timestamp": "03:50:59", "text": "太多事情了。"}]